  "referenceNumber": "RUS3471",
  "remarks": "\nThe Secretary of State considers that there are reasonable grounds to suspect KUNLUN RED STAR ENERGY HOLDINGS LIMITED is an involved entity under the Russia (Sanctions) (EU Exit) Regulations 2019 because it is or has been involved in: owning or controlling directly or indirectly a person carrying on business in the Russian energy sector, which is a sector of strategic significance to the Government of Russia.\n",
